    schema:datePosted "2026-09-02"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Your Mission</strong></p> <p>As an AI Architect you will define scalable and resilient AI agent architectures while establishing reusable patterns, components, and frameworks to support consistent and efficient development.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p> <ul> <li>Design and implement scalable, fault-tolerant agentic architectures.</li> <li>Develop and maintain traceability, monitoring, and evaluation mechanisms for AI systems.</li> <li>Implement guardrails and security measures to ensure safe and compliant AI usage.</li> <li>Build and optimize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines and vector search frameworks.</li> <li>Collaborate with stakeholders to define requirements and communicate technical concepts effectively.</li> <li>Evaluate the feasibility, practicality, and risks associated with AI architectures and workflows.<strong><br></strong></li> </ul> <p><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></p> <ul> <li>Deep understanding of agentic architectural patterns and their practical applications in technology and finance.</li> <li>Proficiency in agentic orchestration frameworks (e.g., LangGraph or similar).</li> <li>Hands-on expertise in Python, with knowledge of both API-first development practices and traditional service-based architecture.</li> <li>Experience with traceability, monitoring, and evaluation techniques.</li> <li>Knowledge of cloud platforms and experience designing cloud-based AI solutions.</li> <li>Understanding of AI governance principles and practices.</li> <li>Excellent verbal and written communication skills for collaboration across technical and non-technical teams.</li> <li>Fluency in German and English&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Why Join Us</strong></p> <ul> <li>Deliver high-impact, <strong>transformational data strategies</strong> for leading financial institutions.</li> <li>Work in a <strong>collaborative, entrepreneurial culture</strong> where your ideas shape the future.</li> <li>Access <strong>continuous learning</strong>, training, and industry certifications.</li> <li>Influence not only client outcomes but also the <strong>strategic direction</strong> of our data practice.</li> <li>Be part of a team that’s redefining the <strong>future of digital financial services</strong>.</li> <li>Capco’s <strong>#BeYourselfAtWork culture</strong> means we celebrate individuality and work in an environment where diverse perspectives truly drive results.</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>If you’re ready to <strong>lead transformation, challenge the status quo, and leave a lasting impact</strong> on the financial services data landscape, we’d like to hear from you.</p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-capco ;
