    schema:description "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"49\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"49\">Principal Consultant – Finance Transformation</strong></p> <p data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"167\"><strong data-start=\"51\" data-end=\"64\">Location:</strong> London (Hybrid) | <strong data-start=\"83\" data-end=\"101\">Practice Area:</strong> Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp; Financial Crime | <strong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"157\">Type:</strong> Permanent</p> <p data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"232\"><strong data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"232\">Empower finance leadership through strategic transformation</strong></p> <p data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"246\"><strong data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"246\">The Role</strong></p> <p data-start=\"248\" data-end=\"863\">Capco is looking for Principal Consultants to join our growing Finance Transformation capability within the Finance, Risk, Regulatory &amp; Financial Crime (FRRF) practice. You'll play a key role in helping CFOs, Treasurers, and senior finance leaders maximise the value of their finance and treasury functions through operating model redesign, process transformation, and strategic technology delivery. You'll also leverage approved AI tools and AI-enabled ways of working to improve analysis, accelerate insight generation, and enhance delivery while applying responsible AI practices and appropriate human oversight.</p> <p data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"883\"><strong data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"883\">What You'll Do</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1953\"> <li data-section-id=\"1g6k904\" data-start=\"885\" data-end=\"1142\">Deliver finance transformation programmes spanning regulatory change (including Basel, IFRS, and PRA), finance technology, process optimisation, and operating model transformation, identifying opportunities to leverage AI-enabled workflows and automation.</li> <li data-section-id=\"8edbjo\" data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1357\">Partner with CFOs, Treasurers, and C-suite stakeholders to implement finance strategies, strengthen controls, and optimise regulatory reporting, including ICAAP, ILAAP, and Recovery and Resolution Planning (RRP).</li> <li data-section-id=\"klrobx\" data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1558\">Define business requirements and manage end-to-end project delivery across finance, treasury, and regulatory change initiatives, ensuring appropriate governance where AI-assisted tools are utilised.</li> <li data-section-id=\"qghjdh\" data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1758\">Design and implement stress testing frameworks across credit, market, and liquidity risk to support regulatory compliance and strategic decision-making, using AI-enabled analysis where appropriate.</li> <li data-section-id=\"19yvcni\" data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1953\">Collaborate with technology teams to embed digital, automation, and AI-enabled solutions into finance processes, architecture, and operating models to improve efficiency and business outcomes.</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1981\"><strong data-start=\"1955\" data-end=\"1981\">What We're Looking For</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2694\"> <li data-section-id=\"1560vvf\" data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2092\">Experience delivering finance transformation programmes within financial services or management consulting.</li> <li data-section-id=\"yu5i43\" data-start=\"2093\" data-end=\"2210\">Strong understanding of finance operating models, accounting processes, regulatory change, and financial reporting.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1p5bqfv\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2341\">Experience with finance technology implementations, including ERP platforms, subledgers, automation, and optimisation solutions.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1na2nhp\" data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2532\">Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with experience using approved AI tools to enhance analysis, productivity, and decision-making while maintaining sound professional judgement.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1tj29qq\" data-start=\"2533\" data-end=\"2694\">Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to influence audiences from project teams through to CFOs and executive leadership.</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2716\"><strong data-start=\"2696\" data-end=\"2716\">Bonus Points For</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"3233\"> <li data-section-id=\"q0ysnn\" data-start=\"2718\" data-end=\"2782\">Professional finance qualification such as ACA, ACCA, or CIMA.</li> <li data-section-id=\"yepuvl\" data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2869\">Familiarity with Basel, Solvency II, IFRS, SOX, PRA, or EBA regulatory requirements.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1rxcgbq\" data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"3027\">Experience delivering finance transformation programmes involving RPA, cloud technologies, AI-enabled solutions, or Generative AI within finance functions.</li> <li data-section-id=\"95f6eb\" data-start=\"3028\" data-end=\"3120\">Strong business analysis or project management credentials such as Agile, PMI, or PRINCE2.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1v17fmy\" data-start=\"3121\" data-end=\"3233\">Experience supporting business development, proposition development, leadership initiatives, or client growth.</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3253\"><strong data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3253\">Why Join Capco</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3685\"> <li data-section-id=\"8o49o2\" data-start=\"3255\" data-end=\"3337\">Deliver high-impact transformation programmes for Tier 1 financial institutions.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1a87gyn\" data-start=\"3338\" data-end=\"3410\">Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1dt1n7l\" data-start=\"3411\" data-end=\"3500\">Access continuous learning, industry certifications, and structured career development.</li> <li data-section-id=\"qdglf4\" data-start=\"3501\" data-end=\"3598\">Help shape the future of finance transformation through innovation, automation, and technology.</li> <li data-section-id=\"7ae7ih\" data-start=\"3599\" data-end=\"3685\">Be part of a team delivering meaningful change across financial services and energy.</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3699\"><strong data-start=\"3687\" data-end=\"3699\">Benefits</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"4704\"> <li data-section-id=\"1sfk404\" data-start=\"3701\" data-end=\"3824\"><strong data-start=\"3703\" data-end=\"3721\">Core Benefits:</strong> Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1yaj5pw\" data-start=\"3825\" data-end=\"3927\"><strong data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3845\">Mental Health:</strong> Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1pqxiiz\" data-start=\"3928\" data-end=\"4089\"><strong data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3950\">Family-Friendly:</strong> Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1nwru6l\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4188\"><strong data-start=\"4092\" data-end=\"4108\">Family Care:</strong> Eight complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.</li> <li data-section-id=\"jxn220\" data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4307\"><strong data-start=\"4191\" data-end=\"4215\">Holiday Flexibility:</strong> Five weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.</li> <li data-section-id=\"16x8480\" data-start=\"4308\" data-end=\"4523\"><strong data-start=\"4310\" data-end=\"4334\">Continuous Learning:</strong> Minimum 40 Hours of Training Annually. Take your pick—workshops, certifications, e-learning—your growth, your way. Business Coach assigned from Day One to help accelerate your development.</li> <li data-section-id=\"1ymgary\" data-start=\"4524\" data-end=\"4579\"><strong data-start=\"4526\" data-end=\"4548\">Healthcare Access:</strong> Convenient online GP services.</li> <li data-section-id=\"5j9nyh\" data-start=\"4580\" data-end=\"4704\"><strong data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4598\">Extra Perks:</strong> Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4728\"><strong data-start=\"4706\" data-end=\"4728\">Inclusion at Capco</strong></p> <p data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"5181\">We're committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know—we'll be happy to help. We value each person's unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration—a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.</p> <p data-start=\"4036\" data-end=\"4497\">&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26);\">#LI-KA1</span></p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-capco ;
