    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">About Baringa&nbsp;</span></h3> <p>Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.</p> <p>The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.</p> <p>Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.</p> <p>Certified as a&nbsp;<em>Great Place to Work </em>around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the <em>Financial Times </em>in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by <em>Forbes </em>for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.</p></div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246395142 BCX8\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\" data-ccp-charstyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Cambria&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,469777844,&quot;Cambria&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Cambria,Arial,ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,268442635,&quot;22&quot;,469775450,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}\">Product &amp; Platform Target Operating Model</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW246395142 BCX8\" data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\"> - Manager / Senior Manager&nbsp;</span></span></span></h2> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\" data-ccp-charstyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Cambria&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,469777844,&quot;Cambria&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Cambria,Arial,ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,268442635,&quot;22&quot;,469775450,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}\">Our </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\">Organisational</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\"> Effectiveness &amp; Agility practice is looking for an experienced Manager or Senior Manager with experience in Product &amp; Platform model transformation</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We help organisations rethink how they organise, govern, fund and deliver products and platforms so they can respond faster to changing customer needs, make better investment decisions and get greater value from technology. Many organisations have made progress towards Agile, Product and Platform ways of working, but still operate with legacy project funding, fragmented technology ownership, unclear accountabilities, duplicated capabilities and governance designed around programmes rather than enduring products and services. We help clients move beyond simply introducing Product roles or Agile ceremonies to fundamentally redesign how strategy, funding, governance, technology, people and delivery come together around products and platforms.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">What you will be doing</span></span></h3> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">As a Manager or Senior Manager, you will play a key role in contributing to and leading workstreams in the design and implementation of Product &amp; Platform operating models, working with business, digital and technology stakeholders to translate strategic priorities into practical changes to organisation, governance, funding, capabilities and ways of working.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are particularly interested in people who can connect the different elements of the Product &amp; Platform model and work with clients on questions such as:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">What should genuinely be managed as a Product or Platform?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Where should accountability for customer, business and technology outcomes sit?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">How should Product, Engineering, Architecture, Data and Operations work together?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">What decisions should teams be empowered to make, and what needs enterprise governance?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">How should investment move from projects towards persistent products and platforms?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">How should demand and capacity be managed across the </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">How should enterprise platforms </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">operate</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> as products for their internal consumers?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">How do we measure whether the Product &amp; Platform model is actually creating more value?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">How do we transition from today's </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> without disrupting critical delivery?</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">You’ll</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> help clients with:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:40,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Product and Platform Centric Operating Model Design:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Helping clients design and implement Product and Platform centric operating models, including product and platform structures, taxonomies, roles, accountabilities, decision rights, governance and persistent multidisciplinary teams.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Portfolio Governance, Funding &amp; Value:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Redesigning governance, investment and prioritisation approaches to better connect strategy, demand, capacity and funding to products and platforms, supported by clear outcomes, OKRs and measures of value.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ways of Working &amp; Delivery Optimisation:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Helping organisations improve how work flows from demand and discovery through delivery and operation, strengthening agile ways of working, planning, prioritisation, team collaboration and the interaction between business, Digital and Technology.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Workforce, Capability &amp; Adoption:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Helping clients define the roles, skills, capacity and capability required to operate Product and Platform centric operating models effectively, while supporting leaders and teams to adopt new accountabilities and ways of working.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"16\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:893,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Transition &amp; Implementation:</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> Translating Product and Platform centric operating model designs into practical roadmaps, pilots and implementation plans, helping clients sequence changes across organisation, governance, workforce, funding and delivery and embed the model sustainably</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:567,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\" data-ccp-charstyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Cambria&quot;,469777842,&quot;Arial&quot;,469777843,&quot;ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,469777844,&quot;Cambria&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Cambria,Arial,ＭＳ 明朝&quot;,268442635,&quot;22&quot;,469775450,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,201340122,&quot;1&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;normaltextrun&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,469778324,&quot;Default Paragraph Font&quot;]}\">Some examples of the work </span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\">you'll</span><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"normaltextrun\"> do:</span></span></strong></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Supporting </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisations</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> moving from project-centric technology delivery towards a persistent Product &amp; Platform model, helping define target structures, accountabilities, governance, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">funding</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and transition roadmaps.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Working with digital and technology leadership teams to define Product &amp; Platform taxonomies, helping </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">determine</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> which capabilities should </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">operate</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> as customer-facing products, enterprise platforms, shared </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">services</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> or enabling functions.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Helping product teams strengthen discovery and product management practices using customer journeys, personas, design thinking, lean start-up approaches, MVPs, value stream </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">mapping</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and story mapping.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Supporting clients to embed a product-centric model that connects strategy and investment decisions to persistent multidisciplinary teams and measurable customer and business outcomes.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Helping define and strengthen platform capabilities, including platform ownership, platform product management, engineering responsibilities, consumption models, service </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">expectations</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and relationships with consuming product teams.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Helping redesign portfolio governance and investment processes to support more persistent investment in products, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">platforms</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and strategic outcomes.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Designing decision rights and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">accountabilities</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> across Product, Technology, Architecture, Operations, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Risk</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and business leadership to increase team autonomy while </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">retaining</span> <span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">appropriate enterprise</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> control.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Helping an </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> redesign its Digital and Technology workforce around Product, Engineering, Data, Design, Architecture and Platform capabilities.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Assessing the maturity of an existing Product </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">identifying</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> practical interventions across </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, governance, funding, capability, tooling, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">leadership</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and ways of working.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Helping </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">establish</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> Product and Platform performance frameworks combining OKRs, customer outcomes, financial measures, flow metrics, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">reliability</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and operational performance.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Supporting leadership teams through the </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">organisational</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">behavioural</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> changes </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">required</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> to embed Product and Platform ways of working at scale.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:709,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:252,&quot;335559991&quot;:425,&quot;469777462&quot;:[360],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[0]}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\">&nbsp;</span></h3> <h3><br><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Your skills and experience</span>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We’re looking for experienced consultants and industry practitioners with a strong foundation in Product &amp; Platform model transformation. You’ll likely bring:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></span></h3> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Strong experience designing and implementing Product &amp; Platform models</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> in large, complex organisations, including organisational structures, roles, accountabilities, decision </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">rights</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and governance.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">A strong understanding of product-centric transformation</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, including the move from project-based delivery to persistent multidisciplinary teams, and how Product Management works with Engineering, Architecture, Data, Design, </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Operations</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and other technology disciplines.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Experience shaping the wider enablers of Product &amp; Platform models</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, including portfolio governance, investment and funding, demand and capacity management, workforce </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">allocation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and outcome-based performance measures.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Practical experience of modern delivery approaches</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, with familiarity across Agile at Scale, OKRs, Lean Portfolio Management, and Team Topologies, and the ability to apply some of these pragmatically rather than prescriptively.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Experience translating operating model designs into practical implementation</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, developing transition roadmaps, supporting organisational </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">change</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\"> and working confidently with senior Digital, Technology, Change and Operational stakeholders through ambiguity.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"15\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Strong consulting and leadership skills</span></span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">, including hypothesis-driven problem solving, working in multidisciplinary teams, developing others, and contributing to proposals and new business opportunities.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:252}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">What a career at Baringa will give you</span>&nbsp;</span></h2> <h3><br><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\">Putting</span> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 0, 111);\">People</span> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">First.</span> </span></h3> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></h3> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Generous Annual Leave Policy:</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> We recognise everyone needs a well-deserved break. We provide our employees with 5 weeks of annual leave, fully available at the start of each year. In addition to this, we have introduced our 5-Year Recharge benefit which allows all employees an additional 2 weeks of paid leave after 5 years continuous service.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1320,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Flexible Working:</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> We know that the ‘ideal’ work-life balance will vary from person to person and change at different stages of our working lives. To accommodate this, we have implemented a hybrid working policy and introduced more flexibility around taking unpaid leave.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1320,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Corporate Responsibility Days:</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> Our world is important to us, so all our employees get 3 every year to help social and environmental causes and increase our impact on the communities that mean the most to us.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1320,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Wellbeing Fund:</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> We want to encourage all employees to take charge and prioritise their own wellbeing. We’ve introduced our annual People Fund to support this by offering every individual a fund to support and manage their wellbeing through an activity of their choice.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1320,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Profit Share Scheme:</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> All employees participate in the Baringa Group Profit Share Scheme so everyone has a stake in the company’s success.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1320,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\" data-contrast=\"none\">Diversity and Inclusion</span></h3> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We are proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. We believe that creating an environment where everyone feels a sense of belonging is central to our culture and that diversity is paramount to driving creativity, innovation, and value for our clients and for our people.</span>&nbsp;</p> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\" data-contrast=\"none\">An award-winning workplace</span></h3> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">You can be a part of our ‘Great Place to Work’ – with our commitment to women and well-being in the workplace for all. </span><a href=\"https://www.baringa.com/en/impact/awards/\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Click here</span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\"> to see some of our recent awards and how we’ve achieved this.</span>&nbsp;</p> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Using business as a force for good.</span>&nbsp;</span></h3> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We maintain high standards of environmental performance and transparency, which can be seen through our commitment to Net Zero with our SBTI-verified Scope 1, 2 and 3 emissions reduction targets and our support of the Better Business Act. We report our progress publicly and ensure that we are also externally assessed and scored through organisations like CDP and EcoVadis - helping us to continually identify where we can improve.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We have a long legacy of supporting the communities in which we work, and offer a variety of ways to contribute, by putting people first and creating impact that lasts. Our Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) agenda is about giving back to the communities in which we live and work by sharing our skills, talent and time. In essence, we aim to empower and encourage everyone in the firm to contribute to the things we care about, and support registered charities and organisations with a clear social or environmental purpose to increase the positive impact they can have.</span></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\" data-teams=\"true\">Join us</span></h3> <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\" data-teams=\"true\">All applications received will be reviewed by a member of our Talent Acquisition team. We never rely solely on automated screening or AI tools to make hiring decisions. Your application will be considered for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, nationality, disability, age, faith or social background. We do not filter applications by university background and encourage those who have taken alternative educational and career paths to apply. We would like to actively encourage applications from those who identify with less represented and minority groups. We operate an inclusive recruitment process, ensuring reasonable adjustments where needed. Please contact a member of our Recruitment Team to discuss further.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(208, 0, 111); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\" data-teams=\"true\">Baringa Privacy Notices</span></h3> <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>For UK &amp; EU</strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our <a href=\"https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-004-ukrpn---uk-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf\">UK Recruitment Privacy Notice / </a><a href=\"https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-005-eurpn---eu-recruitment-privacy-notice-pdf.pdf\">EU Recruitment Privacy Notice</a>, to evaluate your application and meet our legal and reporting obligations. In line with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), you have the right to request access to, rectification, or erasure (subject to legal limitations) of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at <a ---------- <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>For the USA</strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Your personal data may be retained by Baringa for up to two years, as outlined in our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf\">Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp; APAC)</a>, to support the recruitment process and internal reporting requirements. Where applicable, and in accordance with relevant federal and state laws, you may have the right to request access to or correction of your personal information. For further details, please contact <a ---------- <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><strong>For Australia &amp; Singapore</strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Your personal data will be retained by Baringa for up to two years, in accordance with our <a href=\"https://www.baringa.com/globalassets/careers/dp-007-nerpn-amer--apac-recruitment-privacy-notice-word.pdf\">Recruitment Privacy Notice (AMER &amp; APAC)</a>, to assess your application and meet applicable reporting and legal obligations. In line with the Australian Privacy Act and Singapore’s Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA), you may have rights to access, correct, or request limited deletion of your personal data. For more information, please contact us at <a ---------- Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
